        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"893316\">Mikhail Katychev</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/441851-SIG-Packaging/topic/wkg.200.2E16.2E0.20is.20out.21/near/613087749\">said</a> in <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"441851\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/441851-SIG-Packaging/topic/wkg.200.2E16.2E0.20is.20out.21/with/613087749\">#SIG-Packaging &gt; wkg 0.16.0 is out!</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>wkg@0.16.0</code> is out now!<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/releases/tag/v0.16.0\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/releases/tag/v0.16.0</a></p>\n<p>This includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/blob/main/docs/manifest.md#workspacemembers\">intial wkg workspace</a> support</li>\n<li>multi package publish (works with workspaces as well: <code>wkg publish --workspace</code>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/pull/213\">semver validation on publish</a></li>\n<li><code>wkg publish --dry-run</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/tree/main/docs\">updated docs</a></li>\n<li>per registry <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasm-pkg-tools/blob/main/docs/configuration.md#environment-variable-authentication\">authentication envvars</a></li>\n<li>and more!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Still more to do but huge shoutout to <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"598440\">Victor Adossi</span> and <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1034521\">Ryan P</span> for their contributions/help!</p>\n</blockquote>",
